From cf857de00cb5d1821ca58080b96e2d527a7f38d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ARKlight Vocabulary Addendum <arklight@example.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 17:06:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v0.003 addendum 2: even more vocabulary

Add 33 more built-in components as pure schema data (no compiler
logic changes) covering the production-static-site long tail left
after the first vocabulary addendum:

- Lists: OrderedList, DescriptionList/DescriptionTerm/DescriptionDetails
- Responsive images: Picture/PictureSource (+ loading/decoding attrs)
- Native widgets: Progress, Meter, Datalist, Output
- Dialog: zero-JS open/close via Form(method="dialog")
- Text semantics: Kbd, Samp, Var, Data, Ins, Del, Q, Dfn, Address,
  Wbr, Bdi, Bdo, Ruby/Rt/Rp
- Table extras: ColGroup, Col
- Media: Track (captions)
- Image maps: Map, Area
- Embeds: IFrame
- Fallback: NoScript

Extends arklight.ir.schema.SCHEMA (the single source of truth every
pipeline stage already reads from) plus TAG_MAP/PASSTHROUGH_ATTRS/
VOID_TAGS in the HTML backend and default styling in the CSS
backend. normalize.py, validate.py, and build.py are untouched.

22 new tests (109 total, all passing). Updated README/CHANGELOG/
PROGRESS to document the addendum.
